{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/ce24d86c6ee1913a7b6dfcfee7b06dd2.poster.avif?t=1770409934\" width=950 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/ce24d86c6ee1913a7b6dfcfee7b06dd2.webm?t=1770409934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/ce24d86c6ee1913a7b6dfcfee7b06dd2.mp4?t=1770409934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamite Dashers is a fast-paced 2D top-down bomber roguelike</strong> where you play as an explosives expert dwarf blasting everything in his path to get treasure so his village doesn't starve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stick charges to your enemies while dodging projectiles, then blast them into bits at the press of a button. Find treasures hidden within the mine walls and your enemies\u2019 guts to grow stronger after every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/8afab65cd68d63f96b87588d5d19cb09.poster.avif?t=1770409934\" width=390 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/8afab65cd68d63f96b87588d5d19cb09.webm?t=1770409934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/8afab65cd68d63f96b87588d5d19cb09.mp4?t=1770409934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/5143595db0d08b048cd16498a3446d79.poster.avif?t=1770409934\" width=950 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/5143595db0d08b048cd16498a3446d79.webm?t=1770409934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/5143595db0d08b048cd16498a3446d79.mp4?t=1770409934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A New Run. A New Build To Try.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go the more vicious your enemies get, but so do your bombs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain power-ups</strong> as you delve deeper into the mines to blast your enemies to oblivion in a variety of ways, creating your own arsenal build as you go deeper.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experiment with wild builds</strong> using a variety of power-ups, from massive explosions and projectile bursts to autonomous drones that fight for you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/52d0bd9aa46eeeb7ed41a6c02a322a23.poster.avif?t=1770409934\" width=390 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/52d0bd9aa46eeeb7ed41a6c02a322a23.webm?t=1770409934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/52d0bd9aa46eeeb7ed41a6c02a322a23.mp4?t=1770409934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/77996261a31c0555c6a5fe0dca63200c.poster.avif?t=1770409934\" width=952 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/77996261a31c0555c6a5fe0dca63200c.webm?t=1770409934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/77996261a31c0555c6a5fe0dca63200c.mp4?t=1770409934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Kills You <i>Makes </i>You Stronger! </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress beyond each run</strong> with persistent passive upgrades that permanently boost your stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock powerful passives</strong> that enhance movement, damage, and introduce unique effects inspired by game-changing power-ups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong> Nitro Gems during every run, looted from defeated enemies and destructible environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/2259f94bd3896a81b44c5c3cd1b9b87d.poster.avif?t=1770409934\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/extras/2259f94bd3896a81b44c5c3cd1b9b87d.webm?t=1770409934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced</strong> gameplay where every run is different combining the use of tactical bomb-sticking, explosions and <strong>bullet-hell</strong> gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural</strong> levels mixed with tactical bomb placement and bullet-hell action keep every run fresh and unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go from a <strong>firecracker</strong> to a <strong>nuke</strong> with a combination of <strong>power-ups</strong> and <strong>passives</strong> and blast the terrain to kingdom come.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get persistent upgrades</strong> with the gems found through your runs to get stronger as you unlock nodes in the passive tree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the mines and uncover the uncanny biomes that lie within the depths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful bosses</strong> to see if you\u2019re worthy of the deepest treasures of the mines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full gamepad support</strong>, so you can blast <i>any way you want, just the way you need it!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What treasure lies at the deepest reaches of the mine? And moreover, who or what could be guarding it?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4148750?t=1770409934","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4148750?t=1770409934","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/43079e792a7ef2c91c7f38801e143426c3ea3fe1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770409934","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148750/43079e792a7ef2c91c7f38801e143426c3ea3fe1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770409934","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_descriptio